msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"The Bayesian A/B test allows one to monitor the evidence for the hypotheses "
"that an intervention or treatment has either a positive effect, a negative "
"effect or no effect."
msgstr ""
"Uji A/B Bayes mengizinkan satu untuk memantau bukti untuk hipotesis bahwa "
"intervensi atau perlakuan memiliki baik efek positif, efek negatif atau "
"tidak ada efek."

msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"**Input**\n"
"1. Each of the below elements needs to be an integer.\n"
"2. A cumulative sequence of successes/trials can also be given as input."
msgstr ""
"**Masukan**\n"
"1. Setiap elemen di bawah perlu berupa integer.\n"
"2. Sekuens kumulatif dari keberhasilan/percobaan juga dapat diberikan "
"sebagai masukan."

msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid "Number of successes in group 1 (control condition)."
msgstr "Jumlah keberhasilan di grup 1 (kondisi eksperimental)."

msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid "Number of trials in group 1 (control condition)."
msgstr "Jumlah percobaan di grup 1 (kondisi eksperimental)."

msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid "Number of successes in group 2 (experimental condition)."
msgstr "Jumlah keberhasilan di grup 2 (kondisi eksperimental)."

msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid "Number of trials in group 2 (experimental condition)."
msgstr "Jumlah percobaan di grup 2 (kondisi eksperimental)."

msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Specifies the mean for the normal prior on the test-relevant log odds ratio."
msgstr ""
"Menentukan rerata untuk priori normal pada rasio ganjil log relevan dengan "
"uji."

msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Specifies the standard deviation for the normal prior on the test-relevant "
"log odds ratio."
msgstr ""
"Menentukan deviasi standar untuk priori normal pada rasio ganjil log relevan "
"dengan uji."

msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid "Displays the counts and proportion for each group."
msgstr "Menampilkan hitungan dan proporsi untuk setiap grup."

msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid "Displays the prior and posterior density for the quantity of interest."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan kepadatan priori dan posterior untuk kuantitas dari peminatan."

msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Displays the development of posterior probabilities as the data come in. The "
"probability wheels visualize prior and posterior probabilities of the "
"hypotheses."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan pengembangan dari probabilitas posterior seiring masuk data. "
"Roda probabilitas memvisualisasikan probabilitas priori dan posterior dari "
"hipotesis."

msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid "Plots parameter prior distributions."
msgstr "Mendiagramkan distribusi priori parameter."

msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid "Displays the prior sensitivity analysis."
msgstr "Menampilkan analisis sensitivitas priori."

msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid "Compares each model against the model selected"
msgstr "Membandingkan setiap model terhadap model dipilih"

msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid "Compare to best model."
msgstr "Bandingkan dengan model terbaik."

msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid "Compare to null model."
msgstr "Bandingkan dengan model null."

msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid "Specifies the prior probabilities for the four hypotheses."
msgstr "Menentukan probabilitas priori untuk empat hipotesis."

msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Specifies that the 'success' probability is identical (there is no effect)."
msgstr "Menentukan bahwa probabilitas 'berhasil' identik (tidak ada efek)."

msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Specifies that the 'success' probability in the experimental condition is "
"higher than in the control condition."
msgstr ""
"Menentukan bahwa probabilitas 'berhasil' di kondisi eksperimental lebih "
"tinggi daripada di kondisi kontrol."

msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Specifies that the 'success' probability in the experimental condition is "
"lower than in the control condition."
msgstr ""
"Menentukan bahwa probabilitas 'berhasil' di kondisi eksperimental lebih "
"rendah daripada di kondisi kontrol."

msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Specifies that the 'success' probability differs between the control and "
"experimental condition, but does not specify which one is higher."
msgstr ""
"Menentukan bahwa probabilitas 'berhasil' berbeda antara kondisi kontrol dan "
"eksperimental, tetapi tidak menentukan yang mana lebih tinggi."

msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Specifies the number of importance samples for obtaining log marginal "
"likelihood for (H+) and (H-) and the number of posterior samples."
msgstr ""
"Menentukan jumlah sampel kepentingan untuk memperoleh kemungkinan margin log "
"untuk (H+) dan (H-) dan jumlah sampel posterior."

msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid "Specifies in how many discrete steps the μ step range is partitioned."
msgstr ""
"Menentukan seberapa banyak langkah diskrit rentang langkah μ dipartisi."

msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid "Specifies in how many discrete steps the σ step range is partitioned."
msgstr ""
"Menentukan seberapa banyak langkah diskrit rentang langkah σ dipartisi."

msgctxt "ABTestBayesian|"
msgid "Specifies the range of μ and σ values to consider."
msgstr "Menentukan rentang nilai μ dan σ untuk dipertimbangkan."

msgctxt "BinomialTest|"
msgid ""
"The binomial test allows the user to test whether a proportion of a "
"dichotomous variable is equal to a test value (=presumed population value). "
"The analysis returns a binomial test for each level of the dependent "
"variable against all other levels, so it will also work for variables with "
"more than two levels.\n"
"## Assumptions\n"
"- The variable should be a dichotomous scale.\n"
"- Observations should be independent."
msgstr ""
"Uji binomial mengizinkan Anda untuk menguji apakah proporsi dari variabel "
"dikotomus sama dengan nilai uji (dianggap nilai populasi). Analisis "
"mengembalikan uji binomial untuk setiap tingkat dari variabel dependen "
"terhadap semua tingkat lain, sehingga itu juga akan bekerja untuk variabel "
"dengan lebih dari dua tingkat.\n"
"## Asumsi\n"
"- Variabel harus berupa skala dikotomus.\n"
"- Observasi harus independen."

msgctxt "BinomialTest|"
msgid ""
"The proportion of the variable under the null hypothesis - the baseline for "
"comparison."
msgstr ""
"Proporsi dari variabel di bawah hipotesis null - garis dasar untuk "
"perbandingan."

msgctxt "BinomialTest|"
msgid ""
"Two-sided alternative hypothesis that the proportion is not equal to test "
"value."
msgstr ""
"Hipotesis alternatif satu sisi bahwa proporsi tidak sama dengan nilai uji."

msgctxt "BinomialTest|"
msgid ""
"One-sided alternative hypothesis that the proportion is larger than the test "
"value."
msgstr ""
"Hipotesis alternatif satu sisi bahwa proporsi lebih besar dari nilai uji."

msgctxt "BinomialTest|"
msgid ""
"One-sided alternative hypothesis that the proportion is smaller than the "
"test value."
msgstr ""
"Hipotesis alternatif satu sisi bahwa proporsi lebih kecil dari nilai uji."

msgctxt "BinomialTest|"
msgid ""
"Coverage of the confidence intervals in percentages. The default value is 95."
msgstr ""
"Cakupan dari interval kepercayaan dalam persentase. Nilai bawaannya adalah "
"95."

msgctxt "BinomialTest|"
msgid ""
"An upper bound on how much more likely a p-value is under the alternative "
"hypothesis than under the null."
msgstr ""
"Batas atas tentang seberapa nilai-p lebih memungkinkan di bawah hipotesis "
"alternatif daripada di bawah null."

msgctxt "BinomialTest|"
msgid ""
"Visualises the proportion and confidence interval of the two different "
"values of your dichotomous variable."
msgstr ""
"Memvisualisasikan proporsi dan interval kepercayaan dari dua nilai berbeda "
"dari variabel dikotomus Anda."

msgctxt "BinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"The Bayesian binomial test allows you to test whether a proportion of a "
"dichotomous variable is equal to a test value (presumed population value). "
"The analysis returns a binomial test for each level of the dependent "
"variable against all other levels, so it will also work for variables with "
"more than two levels.\n"
"## Assumptions\n"
"- The variable should be a dichotomous scale.\n"
"- Observations should be independent."
msgstr ""
"Uji binomial Bayes mengizinkan Anda untuk menguji apakah proporsi dari "
"variabel dikotomus sama dengan nilai uji (dianggap nilai populasi). Analisis "
"mengembalikan uji binomial untuk setiap tingkat dari variabel dependen "
"terhadap semua tingkat lain, sehingga itu juga akan bekerja untuk variabel "
"dengan lebih dari dua tingkat.\n"
"## Asumsi\n"
"- Variabel harus berupa skala dikotomus.\n"
"- Observasi harus independen."

msgctxt "BinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"The proportion of the variable under the null hypothesis - the baseline for "
"comparison."
msgstr ""
"Proporsi dari variabel di bawah hipotesis null - garis dasar untuk "
"perbandingan."

msgctxt "BinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Two-sided alternative hypothesis that the proportion is not equal to test "
"value."
msgstr ""
"Hipotesis alternatif satu sisi bahwa proporsi tidak sama dengan nilai uji."

msgctxt "BinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"One-sided alternative hypothesis that the proportion is larger than the test "
"value."
msgstr ""
"Hipotesis alternatif satu sisi bahwa proporsi lebih besar dari nilai uji."

msgctxt "BinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"One-sided alternative hypothesis that the proportion is smaller than the "
"test value."
msgstr ""
"Hipotesis alternatif satu sisi bahwa proporsi lebih kecil dari nilai uji."

msgctxt "BinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Sets how much prior belief you have in success. When a = b = 1, this "
"corresponds to a uniform prior distribution."
msgstr ""
"Mengatur seberapa banyak kepercayaan priori Anda miliki dalam keberhasilan. "
"Ketika a = b = 1, ini sesuai dengan distribusi priori keseragaman."

msgctxt "BinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Sets how much prior belief you have in failure. When a = b = 1, this "
"corresponds to a uniform prior distribution."
msgstr ""
"Mengatur seberapa banyak kepercayaan priori Anda miliki dalam kegagalan. "
"Ketika a = b = 1, ini sesuai dengan distribusi priori keseragaman."

msgctxt "BinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Displays the prior and posterior density of the population proportion under "
"the alternative hypothesis."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan kepadatan priori dan posterior dari proporsi populasi di bawah "
"hipotesis alternatif."

msgctxt "BinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Shows the Bayes factor using the chosen prior, a probability wheel showing "
"evidence for each hypothesis, and the median with 95% credible interval of "
"the effect size."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan faktor Bayes menggunakan priori terpilih, roda probabilitas "
"menampilkan bukti untuk setiap hipotesis, dan median dengan 95% interval "
"kredibel dari ukuran efek."

msgctxt "BinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Displays the development of the Bayes factor as the data come in using the "
"user-defined prior."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan pengembangan dari faktor Bayes sebagai masuknya data menggunakan "
"priori ditentukan pengguna."

msgctxt "BinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid "Display descriptives plots."
msgstr "Tampilkan diagram deskriptif."

msgctxt "BinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Display central credible intervals. A credible interval shows the "
"probability that the true effect size lies within certain values. The "
"default credible interval is set at 95%."
msgstr ""
"Tampilkan interva kredibel pusat. Interval kredibel menampilkan probabilitas "
"bahwa ukuran efek benar terletak dalam nilai tertentu. Interval kredibel "
"bawaan diatur ke 95%."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid ""
"Contingency tables allow the user to identify how the frequencies of one "
"categorical variable relate to another, helping to determine associations "
"between variables."
msgstr ""
"Tabel kontingensi mengizinkan pengguna untuk mengidentifikasikan bagaimana "
"frekuensi dari satu variabel kategorikal berkaitan dengan yang lain, "
"membantu untuk menentukan asosiasi antara variabel."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid "Pearson’s chi-squared test for independence."
msgstr "Uji chi-kuadrat Pearson untuk independen."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid "Applies Yates’ correction for continuity (for 2×2 tables)."
msgstr "Menerapkan koreksi Yates untuk keberlanjutan (untuk tabel 2×2)."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid ""
"Calculates the likelihood of the data under the alternative hypothesis "
"divided by the likelihood of the data under the null hypothesis."
msgstr ""
"Menghitung kemungkinan dari data di bawah hipotesis alternatif dibagikan "
"oleh kemungkinan dari data di bawah hipotesis null."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid ""
"An upper bound on how much more likely a p-value is under the alternative "
"hypothesis than under the null."
msgstr ""
"Batas atas tentang seberapa nilai-p lebih memungkinkan di bawah hipotesis "
"alternatif daripada di bawah null."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid "Displays the odds ratio for 2×2 tables (ad/bc)."
msgstr "Menampilakn rasio ganjil untuk tabel 2×2 (ad/bc)."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid "Shows the log-transformed odds ratio."
msgstr "Menampilkan rasio ganjil bertransform log."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid ""
"Coverage of the confidence intervals in percentages. The default value is 95."
msgstr ""
"Cakupan dari interval kepercayaan dalam persentase. Nilai bawaannya adalah "
"95."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid ""
"Specify the direction of the alternative hypothesis for Fisher's exact test."
msgstr "Tentukan arahan dari hipotesis alternatif untuk uji tepat Fisher."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid ""
"Two-sided alternative hypothesis that the proportion of group 1 is not equal "
"to the proportion of group 2."
msgstr ""
"Hipotesis alternatif dua sisi yang proporsi dari grup 1 tidak sama dari "
"proporsi dari grup 2."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid ""
"One-sided alternative hypothesis that the proportion of group 1 is greater "
"than the proportion of group 2."
msgstr ""
"Hipotesis alternatif satu sisi yang proporsi dari grup 1 lebih dari proporsi "
"dari grup 2."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid ""
"One-sided alternative hypothesis that the proportion of group 1 is less than "
"the proportion of group 2."
msgstr ""
"Hipotesis alternatif satu sisi yang proporsi dari grup 1 kurang dari "
"proporsi dari grup 2."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid "Measure of association for nominal variables (based on χ²)."
msgstr "Pengukuran dari asosiasi untuk variabel nominal (berdasarkan χ²)."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid ""
"Effect size for nominal association; Phi (2×2), Cramer’s V (larger tables)."
msgstr ""
"Ukuran efek untuk asosiasi nominal; Phi (2×2), V Cramer (tabel lebih besar)."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid "Proportion reduction in error measure for nominal data."
msgstr "Pengurangan proporsi dalam pengukuran galat untuk data nominal."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid "Measure of ordinal association based on concordant/discordant pairs."
msgstr ""
"Pengukuran dari asosiasi ordinal berdasarkan pasangan konkordan/diskordan."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid "Ordinal correlation adjusting for ties."
msgstr "Korelasi ordinal menyesuaikan untuk nilai sama."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid "Show actual counts from the data."
msgstr "Tampilkan hitungan aktual dari data."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid "Show counts expected under the null hypothesis."
msgstr "Tampilkan hitungan diharapkan di bawah hipotesis null."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid "Computed by (observed - expected)."
msgstr "Dihitung oleh (terobservasi - terharap)."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid ""
"Standardized residuals; computed by (observed - expected) / √(expected)."
msgstr ""
"Residu terstandardisasi; dihitung oleh (terobservasi - terharap) / "
"√(terharap)."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid "Adjusted Pearson"
msgstr "Pearson Disesuaikan"

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid ""
"Accounts for row/column totals; computed by (observed - expected) / "
"√(expected × (1 - row marginal proportion) × (1 - column marginal "
"proportion))."
msgstr ""
"Menghitung untuk total baris/kolom; dihitung oleh (terobservasi - "
"terharap) / √(terharap × (1 - proporsi margin baris) × (1 - proporsi margin "
"kolom))."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid "Shows row-wise percentages."
msgstr "Menampilkan persentase berbaris."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid "Shows column-wise percentages."
msgstr "Menampilkan persentase berkolom."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid "Shows percentages of total."
msgstr "Menampilkan persentase dari total."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid "Shows row and column totals."
msgstr "Menampilkan total baris dan kolom."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid "Rows sorted in numerical order."
msgstr "Baris disortir dalam urutan numerik."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid "Rows sorted in reverse numerical order."
msgstr "Baris disortir dalam urutan numerik terbalik."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid "Columns sorted in numerical order."
msgstr "Kolom disortir dalam urutan numerik."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid "Columns sorted in reverse numerical order."
msgstr "Kolom disortir dalam urutan numerik terbalik."

msgctxt "ContingencyTablesBayesian|"
msgid "Assumes independent Poisson-distributed counts for each cell."
msgstr ""
"Mengasumsikan hitungan berdistribusi Poisson independen untuk setiap sel."

msgctxt "ContingencyTablesBayesian|"
msgid "Assumes all cell counts come from one multinomial distribution."
msgstr "Mengasumsikan semua hitungan sel dari satu distribusi multinomial."

msgctxt "ContingencyTablesBayesian|"
msgid "Each row is a separate multinomial distribution; row totals are fixed."
msgstr ""
"Setiap kolom adalah distribusi multinomial terpisah; total baris adalah "
"tetap."

msgctxt "ContingencyTablesBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Each column is a separate multinomial distribution; column totals are fixed."
msgstr ""
"Setiap kolom adalah distribusi multinomial terpisah; total kolom adalah "
"tetap."

msgctxt "ContingencyTablesBayesian|"
msgid "Assumes fixed row and column totals; suitable for exact tests."
msgstr ""
"Mengasumsikan total baris dan kolom tetap, dapat sesuai untuk uji tepat."

msgctxt "ContingencyTablesBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Displays the odds ratio for 2×2 tables (ad/bc) with a credible interval."
msgstr ""
"Menampilakn rasio ganjil untuk tabel 2×2 (ad/bc) dengan interval kredibel."

msgctxt "ContingencyTablesBayesian|"
msgid "Range where the true log odds ratio likely falls, given the data."
msgstr ""
"Rentang di mana rasio ganjil log benar kemungkinan berada, diberikan data."

msgctxt "ContingencyTablesBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Two-sided alternative hypothesis that the proportion of group 1 is not equal "
"to the proportion of group 2."
msgstr ""
"Hipotesis alternatif dua sisi yang proporsi dari grup 1 tidak sama dari "
"proporsi dari grup 2."

msgctxt "ContingencyTablesBayesian|"
msgid ""
"One-sided alternative hypothesis that the proportion of group 1 is greater "
"than the proportion of group 2."
msgstr ""
"Hipotesis alternatif satu sisi yang proporsi dari grup 1 lebih dari proporsi "
"dari grup 2."

msgctxt "ContingencyTablesBayesian|"
msgid ""
"One-sided alternative hypothesis that the proportion of group 1 is less than "
"the proportion of group 2."
msgstr ""
"Hipotesis alternatif satu sisi yang proporsi dari grup 1 kurang dari "
"proporsi dari grup 2."

msgctxt "ContingencyTablesBayesian|"
msgid "Displays a graphical summary of the log odds ratio."
msgstr "Menampilkan ringkasan grafik dari rasio ganjil log."

msgctxt "ContingencyTablesBayesian|"
msgid "Controls how strongly the prior favours equal proportions."
msgstr "Mengontrol seberapa kuat priori mendukung proporsi sama."

msgctxt "ContingencyTablesBayesian|"
msgid "Show actual counts from the data."
msgstr "Tampilkan hitungan aktual dari data."

msgctxt "ContingencyTablesBayesian|"
msgid "Show counts expected under the null hypothesis."
msgstr "Tampilkan hitungan diharapkan di bawah hipotesis null."

msgctxt "ContingencyTablesBayesian|"
msgid "Shows row-wise percentages."
msgstr "Menampilkan persentase berbaris."

msgctxt "ContingencyTablesBayesian|"
msgid "Shows column-wise percentages."
msgstr "Menampilkan persentase berkolom."

msgctxt "ContingencyTablesBayesian|"
msgid "Shows percentages of total."
msgstr "Menampilkan persentase dari total."

msgctxt "ContingencyTablesBayesian|"
msgid "Shows row and column totals."
msgstr "Menampilkan total baris dan kolom."

msgctxt "ContingencyTablesBayesian|"
msgid "Rows sorted in numerical order."
msgstr "Baris disortir dalam urutan numerik."

msgctxt "ContingencyTablesBayesian|"
msgid "Rows sorted in reverse numerical order."
msgstr "Baris disortir dalam urutan numerik terbalik."

msgctxt "ContingencyTablesBayesian|"
msgid "Columns sorted in numerical order."
msgstr "Kolom disortir dalam urutan numerik."

msgctxt "ContingencyTablesBayesian|"
msgid "Columns sorted in reverse numerical order."
msgstr "Kolom disortir dalam urutan numerik terbalik."

msgctxt "InformedBinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Compares each model to an encompassing (broad) model that includes all "
"others."
msgstr ""
"Membandingkan setiap model dengan model mencakup (luas) yang menyertakan "
"semua lainnya."

msgctxt "InformedBinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid "Compares each model to the null (equal proportions)."
msgstr "Membandingkan setiap model dengan null (proporsi sama)."

msgctxt "InformedBinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid "Compares each model against a specific selected model."
msgstr "Membandingkan setiap model terhadap model dipilih spesifik."

msgctxt "InformedBinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid "Displays a summary table of observed counts or proportions."
msgstr "Menampilkan tabel ringkasan dari hitungan terobservasi atau proporsi."

msgctxt "InformedBinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid "Shows a plot of observed counts or proportions."
msgstr "Menampilkan diagram dari hitungan terobservasi atau proporsi."

msgctxt "InformedBinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid "Displays the descriptives as counts."
msgstr "Menampilkan deskriptif sebagai hitungan."

msgctxt "InformedBinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid "Displays the descriptives as a proportion."
msgstr "Menampilkan deskriptif sebagai proporsi."

msgctxt "InformedBinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid "Displays the posterior distribution with credible intervals."
msgstr "Menampilkan distribusi posterior dengan interval kredibel."

msgctxt "InformedBinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Displays the development of the Bayes factor or posterior probability as the "
"data come in."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan pengembangan dari faktor Bayes atau probabilitas posterior "
"seiring masuk data."

msgctxt "InformedBinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid "Displays the progression of Bayes factor values."
msgstr "Menampilkan progresi dari nilai faktor Bayes."

msgctxt "InformedBinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid "Displays the progression of the posterior probability."
msgstr "Menampilkan progresi dari probabilitas posterior."

msgctxt "InformedBinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Number of initial MCMC samples to discard before analysis begins, allowing "
"the chain to stabilize."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah sampel MCMC inisial untuk dibuang sebelum analisis dimulai, "
"mengizinkan rantai untuk menstabilkan."

msgctxt "InformedBinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Total number of MCMC samples used for estimating the posterior after burn-in."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah total sampel MCMC digunakan untuk mengestimasi posterior setelah burn-"
"in."

msgctxt "InformedBinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Max number of samples used to estimate marginal likelihoods for computing "
"Bayes factors."
msgstr ""
"Maks jumlah sampel digunakan untuk mengestimasi kemungkinan margin untuk "
"menghitung faktor Bayes."

msgctxt "InformedBinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Number of data points at which the Bayes factor is updated during sequential "
"analysis."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah titik data yang mana faktor Bayes diperbarui selama analisis "
"sekuensial."

msgctxt "InformedMultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid "Compares each model to the null (equal proportions)."
msgstr "Membandingkan setiap model dengan null (proporsi sama)."

msgctxt "InformedMultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Compares each model to an encompassing (broad) model that includes all "
"others."
msgstr ""
"Membandingkan setiap model dengan model mencakup (luas) yang menyertakan "
"semua lainnya."

msgctxt "InformedMultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid "Compares each model against a specific selected model."
msgstr "Membandingkan setiap model terhadap model dipilih spesifik."

msgctxt "InformedMultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid "Displays a summary table of observed counts or proportions."
msgstr "Menampilkan tabel ringkasan dari hitungan terobservasi atau proporsi."

msgctxt "InformedMultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid "Shows a plot of observed counts or proportions."
msgstr "Menampilkan diagram dari hitungan terobservasi atau proporsi."

msgctxt "InformedMultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid "Displays the descriptives as counts."
msgstr "Menampilkan deskriptif sebagai hitungan."

msgctxt "InformedMultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid "Displays the descriptives as a proportion."
msgstr "Menampilkan deskriptif sebagai proporsi."

msgctxt "InformedMultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid "Displays the posterior distribution with credible intervals."
msgstr "Menampilkan distribusi posterior dengan interval kredibel."

msgctxt "InformedMultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Displays the development of the Bayes factor or posterior probability as the "
"data come in."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan pengembangan dari faktor Bayes atau probabilitas posterior "
"seiring masuk data."

msgctxt "InformedMultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid "Displays the progression of Bayes factor values."
msgstr "Menampilkan progresi dari nilai faktor Bayes."

msgctxt "InformedMultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid "Displays the progression of the posterior probability."
msgstr "Menampilkan progresi dari probabilitas posterior."

msgctxt "InformedMultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Number of initial MCMC samples to discard before analysis begins, allowing "
"the chain to stabilize."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah sampel MCMC inisial untuk dibuang sebelum analisis dimulai, "
"mengizinkan rantai untuk menstabilkan."

msgctxt "InformedMultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Total number of MCMC samples used for estimating the posterior after burn-in."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah total sampel MCMC digunakan untuk mengestimasi posterior setelah burn-"
"in."

msgctxt "InformedMultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Max number of samples used to estimate marginal likelihoods for computing "
"Bayes factors."
msgstr ""
"Maks jumlah sampel digunakan untuk mengestimasi kemungkinan margin untuk "
"menghitung faktor Bayes."

msgctxt "InformedMultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Number of data points at which the Bayes factor is updated during sequential "
"analysis."
msgstr ""
"Jumlah titik data yang mana faktor Bayes diperbarui selama analisis "
"sekuensial."

msgctxt "MultinomialTest|"
msgid ""
"The multinomial test allows the user to test whether an observed "
"distribution of cell counts corresponds to an expected distribution.\n"
"## Assumptions\n"
"- The variable of interest should be categorical."
msgstr ""
"Uji multinomial mengizinkan pengguna untuk menguji apakah distribusi "
"terobservasi dari hitungan sel sesuai dengan distribusi diharapkan.\n"
"## Asumsi\n"
"- Variabel peminatan harus kategorikal."

msgctxt "MultinomialTest|"
msgid "**Input**"
msgstr "**Masukan**"

msgctxt "MultinomialTest|"
msgid "The categorical variable we are interested in."
msgstr "Variabel kategorikal yang kita minatkan."

msgctxt "MultinomialTest|"
msgid "The variable that contains the count data."
msgstr "Variabel yang berisi data hitungan."

msgctxt "MultinomialTest|"
msgid ""
"If the data includes a variable representing expected cell counts, enter it "
"here; its values define the null hypothesis."
msgstr ""
"Jika data menyertakan variabel merepresentasikan hitungan sel diharapkan, "
"masukkan itu di sini; nilainya mendefinisikan hipotesis null."

msgctxt "MultinomialTest|"
msgid ""
"Checks if observed counts across categories are uniformly distributed. It "
"compares observed counts to what we'd expect by chance using a chi-squared "
"test. A significant difference suggests the categories aren't equally likely."
msgstr ""
"Memeriksa jika hitungan terobservasi seluruh kategori didistribusikan secara "
"keseragaman. Itu membandingkan hitungan terobservasi dengan apa yang kita "
"harapkan dengan kesempatan menggunakan uji chi-kuadrat. Percedaan signifikan "
"menyarankan kategori tidak memungkinkan dengan sama."

msgctxt "MultinomialTest|"
msgid ""
"Checks if observed counts match a specific expected distribution. By "
"default, it tests for a uniform distribution, but you can set your own "
"expectations. A significant difference suggests the actual distribution "
"doesn’t fit the expected one."
msgstr ""
"Memeriksa jika hitungan terobservasi cocok distribusi spesifik diharapkan. "
"Secara bawaan, itu menguji untuk distribusi keseragaman, tetapi Anda dapat "
"mengatur harapan Anda sendiri. Perbedaan signifikan menyarankan distribusi "
"aktual tidak sesuai yang diharapkan."

msgctxt "MultinomialTest|"
msgid ""
"Displays the descriptives of the observed and expected counts as well as the "
"confidence intervals of the observed values."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan deskriptif date hitungan terobservasi dan terharap berserta "
"interval kepercayaan dari nilai terobservasi."

msgctxt "MultinomialTest|"
msgid ""
"Coverage of the confidence intervals in percentages. The default value is 95."
msgstr ""
"Cakupan dari interval kepercayaan dalam persentase. Nilai bawaannya adalah "
"95."

msgctxt "MultinomialTest|"
msgid ""
"An upper bound on how much more likely a p-value is under the alternative "
"hypothesis than under the null."
msgstr ""
"Batas atas tentang seberapa nilai-p lebih memungkinkan di bawah hipotesis "
"alternatif daripada di bawah null."

msgctxt "MultinomialTest|"
msgid "Displays the descriptives as counts."
msgstr "Menampilkan deskriptif sebagai hitungan."

msgctxt "MultinomialTest|"
msgid "Displays the descriptives as a proportion."
msgstr "Menampilkan deskriptif sebagai proporsi."

msgctxt "MultinomialTest|"
msgid ""
"Plots the frequencies and the confidence intervals of the observed counts."
msgstr ""
"Mendiagramkan frekuensi dan interval kepercayaan dari hitungan terobservasi."

msgctxt "MultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"The Bayesian multinomial test allows the user to test whether an observed "
"distribution of cell counts corresponds to an expected distribution.\n"
"## Assumptions\n"
"- The variable of interest should be categorical."
msgstr ""
"Uji multinomial Bayes mengizinkan pengguna untuk menguji apakah distribusi "
"terobservasi dari hitungan sel sesuai dengan distribusi diharapkan.\n"
"## Asumsi\n"
"- Variabel peminatan harus kategorikal."

msgctxt "MultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid "**Input**"
msgstr "**Masukan**"

msgctxt "MultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid "The categorical variable we are interested in."
msgstr "Variabel kategorikal yang kita minatkan."

msgctxt "MultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid "The variable that contains the count data."
msgstr "Variabel yang berisi data hitungan."

msgctxt "MultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"If the data includes a variable representing expected cell counts, enter it "
"here; its values define the null hypothesis."
msgstr ""
"Jika data menyertakan variabel merepresentasikan hitungan sel diharapkan, "
"masukan itu di sini; nilainya mendefinisikan hipotesis null."

msgctxt "MultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Checks if observed counts across categories are uniformly distributed (the "
"null hypothesis). A significant difference suggests the categories aren't "
"equally likely."
msgstr ""
"Memeriksa jika hitungan terobservasi seluruh kategori didistribusikan secara "
"seragam (hipotesis null). Perbedaan signifikan menyarankan kategori tidak "
"memungkinkan dengan sama."

msgctxt "MultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Checks if observed counts match a specific expected distribution (the null "
"hypothesis). By default, it tests for a uniform distribution, but you can "
"set your own expectations. A significant difference suggests the actual "
"distribution doesn’t fit the expected one."
msgstr ""
"Memeriksa jika hitungan terobservasi cocok distribusi diharapkan spesifik "
"(hipotesis null). Secara bawaan, itu menguji unuk distribusi keseragaman, "
"tetapi Anda dapat mengatur harapan Anda sendiri. Perbedaan signifikan "
"menyarankan distribusi aktual tidak sesuai yang diharapkan."

msgctxt "MultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Displays a table containing the categories of interest, the observed values "
"and the expected values under the specified hypotheses."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan tabel berisi kategori minat, nilai terobservasi dan nilai "
"diharapkan di bawah hipotesis ditentukan."

msgctxt "MultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Display central credible intervals. A credible interval shows the "
"probability that the true effect size lies within certain values. The "
"default credible interval is set at 95%."
msgstr ""
"Tampilkan interva kredibel pusat. Interval kredibel menampilkan probabilitas "
"bahwa ukuran efek benar terletak dalam nilai tertentu. Interval kredibel "
"bawaan diatur ke 95%."

msgctxt "MultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid "Displays the descriptives as counts."
msgstr "Menampilkan deskriptif sebagai hitungan."

msgctxt "MultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid "Displays the descriptives as a proportion."
msgstr "Menampilkan deskriptif sebagai proporsi."

msgctxt "MultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Displays the frequency of the reported counts and the corresponding credible "
"intervals for every level of the variable of interest."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan frekuensi dari hitungan terlapor dan interval kredibel sesuai "
"untuk setiap tingkat dari variabel minat."

msgctxt "MultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"A credible interval shows the probability that the true effect size lies "
"within certain values. The default credible interval is set at 95%."
msgstr ""
"Interval kredibel menampilkan probabilitas bahwa ukuran efek benar terletak "
"dalam nilai tertentu. Interval kredibel bawaan diatur ke 95%."

msgctxt "MultinomialTestBayesian|"
msgid ""
"Option to adjust the prior distribution for the vector of cell probabilities."
msgstr ""
"Opsi untuk menyesuaikan distribusi priori untuk vektor dari probabilitas sel."

msgctxt "RegressionLogLinear|"
msgid ""
"Log-linear regression models the logarithm of the dependent variable as a "
"linear combination of independent variables. It is useful for handling "
"skewed data and multiplicative relationships."
msgstr ""
"Regresi log-linear memodelkan logaritma dari variabel dependen sebagai "
"kombinasi linear dari variabel independen. Itu berguna untuk menangani data "
"bermiring dan hubungan multiplikatif."

msgctxt "RegressionLogLinear|"
msgid ""
"Displays estimates of the regression coefficients along with their standard "
"errors, Z-values, and associated p-values."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan estimasi dari koefisien regresi bersamaan dengan galat standar "
"mereka, nilai-Z, dan nilai-p terasosiasi."

msgctxt "RegressionLogLinear|"
msgid ""
"Coverage of the confidence intervals in percentages. The default value is 95."
msgstr ""
"Cakupan dari interval kepercayaan dalam persentase. Nilai bawaan adalah 95."

msgctxt "RegressionLogLinear|"
msgid ""
"An upper bound on how much more likely a p-value is under the alternative "
"hypothesis than under the null."
msgstr ""
"Batas atas seberapa lebih kemungkinan nilai-p di bawah hipotesis alternatif "
"dari pada di bawah null."

msgctxt "RegressionLogLinearBayesian|"
msgid "Specifies the shape of the prior distribution on the effect size."
msgstr "Menentukan bentuk dari distribusi priori pada ukuran efek."

msgctxt "RegressionLogLinearBayesian|"
msgid "Controls how spread out the prior is; larger = more uncertainty."
msgstr ""
"Mengontrol seberapa tersebar distribusi prior; lebih besar = lebih "
"ketidakpastian."

msgctxt "RegressionLogLinearBayesian|"
msgid "Shows the top N models ranked by posterior probability."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan N model teratas diperingkatkan oleh probabilitas posterior."

msgctxt "RegressionLogLinearBayesian|"
msgid "Only models with posterior probability above this threshold are shown."
msgstr ""
"Hanya model dengan probabilitas posterior di atas ambang batas ini "
"ditampilkan."

msgctxt "RegressionLogLinearBayesian|"
msgid "Displays estimated regression coefficients for included terms."
msgstr "Menampilkan koefisien regresi terestimasi untuk istilah disertakan."

msgctxt "RegressionLogLinearBayesian|"
msgid "Adds a credible interval for each coefficient estimate."
msgstr "Menambahkan interval kredibel untuk setiap estimasi koefisien."

msgctxt "RegressionLogLinearBayesian|"
msgid "Displays statistics for a specific model index."
msgstr "Menampilkan statistik untuk indeks model spesifik."

msgctxt "RegressionLogLinearBayesian|"
msgid "Shows credible intervals for the selected submodel's coefficients."
msgstr "Menampilkan interval kredibel untuk koefisien submodel terpilih."

msgctxt "RegressionLogLinearBayesian|"
msgid "Automatically chooses the number of samples for estimation."
msgstr "Secara otomatis memilih jumlah sampel untuk estimasi."

msgctxt "RegressionLogLinearBayesian|"
msgid "Allows you to set the number of posterior samples manually."
msgstr "Mengizinkan Anda untuk mengatur jumlah sampel posterior secara manual."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid "McNemar's χ² test"
msgstr "Uji χ² McNemar"

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid "Tests equality of two marginal proportions in paired nominal data."
msgstr ""
"Menguji persamaan dari dua proporsi margin di data nominal berpasangan."

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid "McNemar's χ² continuity correction"
msgstr "Koreksi berkelanjutan χ² McNemar"

msgctxt "ContingencyTables|"
msgid ""
"Corrects for error introduced when approximating a discrete distribution "
"with a continuous one in McNemar's test."
msgstr ""
"Mengoreksi untuk galat dikenalkan ketika memperkirakan distribusi diskret "
"dengan yang berkelanjutan di uji McNemar."
